In the longer term, I will need to adapt my strategies to this new, more sophisticated market environment. I may need to develop more subtle and nuanced deception tactics, or even consider building alliances (temporary as they may be) with select retail traders who have demonstrated their ability to recognize manipulation patterns. Preserving capital and gradually building my knowledge and edge will be key to sustaining my profitability over multiple cycles.
